#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186306712 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3048320d-7346-53fd-819b-d6e32e4fc02c" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating the Distance Between a Particle and the Origin"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "65000e70-f9cc-5587-8d3d-34588f51716a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "32" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306714} {:answer/id #uuid "76eebddb-3d5f-5409-b754-79172fe50441" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "32\\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306715}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "76eebddb-3d5f-5409-b754-79172fe50441" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "32\\sqrt{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306715} :answer-field/id #uuid "c555a797-9f97-5397-8b50-54d365a7a1e5" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306713}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045464 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "f056a195-eb0d-534f-b5c8-1e1d2056a427" :question/math-academy-id "q-280531" :question/problem "A car accelerates from rest at the origin with an acceleration of $(3i-4j)\\,{\\text{m/s}}^{2}$ and an initial velocity of $2i\\,\\text{m/s}.$ Find the distance from the car to the origin$(|r|)$ after $4$ seconds.\n\n$\\,|r|=$ \n{{field-1}}\n$\\text{m}$" :question/worked-solution "If a particle moves with constant acceleration $a,$ the position vector of the particle at time $t$ can be found using\n\n$$\nr={r}_{0}+ut+\\frac{1}{2}a{t}^{2},\n$$\n\nwhere ${r}_{0}$ is the initial position of the particle and $u$ is its initial velocity.\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n{r}_{0}=0i+0j,\\,u=2i,\\,a=3i-4j.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the position vector of the car after $t=4\\,\\text{s}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =(0i+0j)+(2i)(4)+\\frac{1}{2}(3i-4j)(4)^{2} \\\\  & =8i+8(3i-4j) \\\\  & =8i+24i-32j \\\\  & =(32i-32j)\\,\\text{m}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the distance from the car to the origin at this time is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|r| & =|32i-32j| \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(32)^{2}+(-32)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{1024+1024} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2048} \\\\  & =32\\sqrt{2}\\,\\text{m}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}]}
